# Copy to .env; the Makefile reads it. Defaults suit a local PostgreSQL 17
# with trust auth (Homebrew). For `make db-up`, use the Compose passwords.
# PG_ADMIN_URL=postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/postgres?sslmode=disable
# QUICKSTACK_DATABASE_URL=postgres://quickstack_app:app@localhost:5432/quickstack?sslmode=disable
# QUICKSTACK_MIGRATE_URL=postgres://quickstack_owner:owner@localhost:5432/quickstack?sslmode=disable
# E2E_DATABASE_URL=postgres://quickstack_app:app@localhost:5432/quickstack_e2e?sslmode=disable
# E2E_MIGRATE_URL=postgres://quickstack_owner:owner@localhost:5432/quickstack_e2e?sslmode=disable
# Without SMTP, mail goes to the server log, and with QUICKSTACK_DEV=1 to /dev/mail.
# QUICKSTACK_SMTP_URL=smtp://user:password@smtp.example.com:587
# QUICKSTACK_MAIL_FROM=Quickstack <noreply@example.com>
